[0.82.1]
* Initial public packaging for Cloudron: PostgreSQL (vector), Redis, localstorage, sendmail addons; `start.sh` maps `CLOUDRON_*` to Activepieces env; upstream 0.82.1.
* Health check: `GET /api/v1/health`.
* Execution: `UNSANDBOXED` (required for typical Cloudron container permissions); see README.
